{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01AxbbZjNJDGbcxwe6Z2YomZ","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Paper Framing — ratekv\n2\t\n3\t## Target Venue\n4\t- Primary: EMNLP 2026 Main (ARR submission)\n5\t- Deadline: ARR May 25, 2026 (11 days from today 2026-05-14)\n6\t- Track: Efficient Methods for NLP\n7\t\n8\t## Core Insight\n9\t\n10\tPer-head independent distortion profiling systematically underestimates joint degradation at extreme quantization levels due to compounding effects. A constrained MCKP formulation bridges this gap: cardinality constraints on extreme bit-widths act as principled regularization for profiler systematic errors, enabling automatic near-optimal per-head bit-width allocation for KV cache quantization.\n11\t\n12\t## Core Claims (3 条)\n13\t\n14\t1. **Head sensitivity heterogeneity**: Per-KV-head quantization sensitivity in modern LLMs is extremely non-uniform — Layer 0 heads exhibit 100× higher profiling delta than average, and 3.6% of heads determine 70%+ of total PPL degradation under uniform quantization.\n15\t\n16\t2. **Constrained MCKP outperforms uniform and manual allocation**: A constrained MCKP solver over discrete bit-width action space {2,4,8,16}-bit with cardinality constraints achieves 27% PPL improvement over uniform 4-bit at matched 4× compression budget (11.23 vs 15.45), and outperforms hand-designed oracle strategies (11.23 vs 11.69).\n17\t\n18\t3. **Cardinality constraints as profiler error regularization**: Unconstrained solvers that trust per-head independent profiling produce catastrophic allocations (PPL 36.92) because additive distortion models fail when many heads are simultaneously assigned extreme quantization. Cardinality constraints (≤k heads at 2-bit) regularize this non-additivity, and the optimal k can be determined by a small-scale compounding effect test.\n19\t\n20\t## Story Spine\n21\t\n22\t- **Problem**: KV cache quantization typically applies uniform bit-width across all heads, wasting budget on insensitive heads while under-protecting critical ones. Per-head mixed-precision allocation promises better quality-compression tradeoffs, but existing approaches (RateQuant's reverse waterfilling) assume continuous bit-width and additive distortion — both assumptions break in practice.\n23\t\n24\t- **Existing approaches & gaps**: RateQuant (May 2026) provides R-D optimal per-head allocation via reverse waterfilling, but only for continuous bit-width selection and cannot handle discrete action sets or non-additive compounding effects. ARKV (March 2026) does per-layer heuristic selection but lacks per-head granularity and optimality guarantees. No existing method addresses the fundamental gap between independent per-head profiling and joint quantization effects.\n25\t\n26\t- **Our framing**: We formulate per-head bit-width allocation as a constrained MCKP over discrete bit-widths. The key insight is that cardinality constraints on extreme quantization levels (2-bit) serve as principled regularization for profiler systematic errors — specifically, the non-additivity of extreme quantization that independent profiling cannot capture. This makes the solver robust to imperfect distortion estimates while preserving near-optimality.\n27\t\n28\t- **Headline result template**: \"On Qwen2.5-7B, constrained MCKP allocation achieves PPL 11.23 at 4× KV cache compression, a 27% improvement over uniform 4-bit (PPL 15.45) and better than hand-designed oracle strategies (PPL 11.69), with the solver automatically discovering that Layer 0 heads require 8-bit protection.\"\n29\t\n30\t## Differentiation from RateQuant\n31\t\n32\t| Aspect | RateQuant | Ours |\n33\t|--------|-----------|------|\n34\t| Bit-width selection | Continuous (reverse waterfilling) | Discrete MCKP ({2,4,8,16}-bit) |\n35\t| Distortion model | Additive, parametric D(b)=α·β^{-b} | Additive + cardinality regularization |\n36\t| Compounding effects | Not addressed | Explicitly handled via constraints |\n37\t| Action space | Homogeneous (quantization only) | Heterogeneous (multiple discrete bit-widths) |\n38\t| Optimality | Under additive assumption | Near-optimal with regularized profiling |\n39\t\n40\t## Venue Fit Risks\n41\t\n42\t- **Incrementality over RateQuant**: Strongest reviewer attack. Defense: (a) discrete MCKP is fundamentally different from continuous waterfilling, (b) compounding effect discovery and constraint-based regularization are novel contributions, (c) RateQuant's additive assumption demonstrably fails (PPL 36.92 vs 11.23).\n43\t- **Single-domain evaluation**: KV cache quantization only. Mitigate by testing across model families (Qwen, Llama, Mistral) with different GQA ratios.\n44\t- **No eviction arm**: Original idea proposed joint eviction+quantization. Eviction was abandoned after MVP (attention MSE fails as distortion proxy for eviction). Mention as negative finding in paper; the MCKP framework itself extends naturally to include eviction once better eviction distortion metrics are developed.\n45\t\n46\t## Anticipated Reviewer Concerns\n47\t\n48\t1. **\"This is just RateQuant with MCKP instead of waterfilling\"** → Show waterfilling fails on discrete action sets (counterexample); show unconstrained MCKP also fails (PPL 36.92); our contribution is the constraint-regularized formulation.\n49\t2. **\"Only tested on one model\"** → Multi-model experiments (Llama, Mistral) are P0.\n50\t3. **\"Cardinality constraint is just a heuristic\"** → Show it has principled motivation (compounding effect non-additivity); characterize the compounding threshold empirically; show constraint value k can be determined systematically.\n51\t4. **\"How does this work at different compression ratios?\"** → Budget sweep across 2×, 4×, 8× compression.\n52\t5. **\"Profiler resolution is too low for mid-layer differentiation\"** → High-res profiling experiment (64 seq × 2048 tokens) to explore.\n53\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8677deac-59c8-4ca5-9523-f1a6bbd8dccb","uuid":"9ce9d038-554c-4208-bd71-6b2fa5ea195e","timestamp":"2026-05-14T00:44:54.524Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_2/projects/ratekv/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260514T002109/worst/paper_framing.md","content":"# Paper Framing — ratekv\n\n## Target Venue\n- Primary: EMNLP 2026 Main (ARR submission)\n- Deadline: ARR May 25, 2026 (11 days from today 2026-05-14)\n- Track: Efficient Methods for NLP\n\n## Core Insight\n\nPer-head independent distortion profiling systematically underestimates joint degradation at extreme quantization levels due to compounding effects. A constrained MCKP formulation bridges this gap: cardinality constraints on extreme bit-widths act as principled regularization for profiler systematic errors, enabling automatic near-optimal per-head bit-width allocation for KV cache quantization.\n\n## Core Claims (3 条)\n\n1. **Head sensitivity heterogeneity**: Per-KV-head quantization sensitivity in modern LLMs is extremely non-uniform — Layer 0 heads exhibit 100× higher profiling delta than average, and 3.6% of heads determine 70%+ of total PPL degradation under uniform quantization.\n\n2. **Constrained MCKP outperforms uniform and manual allocation**: A constrained MCKP solver over discrete bit-width action space {2,4,8,16}-bit with cardinality constraints achieves 27% PPL improvement over uniform 4-bit at matched 4× compression budget (11.23 vs 15.45), and outperforms hand-designed oracle strategies (11.23 vs 11.69).\n\n3. **Cardinality constraints as profiler error regularization**: Unconstrained solvers that trust per-head independent profiling produce catastrophic allocations (PPL 36.92) because additive distortion models fail when many heads are simultaneously assigned extreme quantization. Cardinality constraints (≤k heads at 2-bit) regularize this non-additivity, and the optimal k can be determined by a small-scale compounding effect test.\n\n## Story Spine\n\n- **Problem**: KV cache quantization typically applies uniform bit-width across all heads, wasting budget on insensitive heads while under-protecting critical ones. Per-head mixed-precision allocation promises better quality-compression tradeoffs, but existing approaches (RateQuant's reverse waterfilling) assume continuous bit-width and additive distortion — both assumptions break in practice.\n\n- **Existing approaches & gaps**: RateQuant (May 2026) provides R-D optimal per-head allocation via reverse waterfilling, but only for continuous bit-width selection and cannot handle discrete action sets or non-additive compounding effects. ARKV (March 2026) does per-layer heuristic selection but lacks per-head granularity and optimality guarantees. No existing method addresses the fundamental gap between independent per-head profiling and joint quantization effects.\n\n- **Our framing**: We formulate per-head bit-width allocation as a constrained MCKP over discrete bit-widths. The key insight is that cardinality constraints on extreme quantization levels (2-bit) serve as principled regularization for profiler systematic errors — specifically, the non-additivity of extreme quantization that independent profiling cannot capture. This makes the solver robust to imperfect distortion estimates while preserving near-optimality.\n\n- **Headline result template**: \"On Qwen2.5-7B, constrained MCKP allocation achieves PPL 11.23 at 4× KV cache compression, a 27% improvement over uniform 4-bit (PPL 15.45) and better than hand-designed oracle strategies (PPL 11.69), with the solver automatically discovering that Layer 0 heads require 8-bit protection.\"\n\n## Differentiation from RateQuant\n\n| Aspect | RateQuant | Ours |\n|--------|-----------|------|\n| Bit-width selection | Continuous (reverse waterfilling) | Discrete MCKP ({2,4,8,16}-bit) |\n| Distortion model | Additive, parametric D(b)=α·β^{-b} | Additive + cardinality regularization |\n| Compounding effects | Not addressed | Explicitly handled via constraints |\n| Action space | Homogeneous (quantization only) | Heterogeneous (multiple discrete bit-widths) |\n| Optimality | Under additive assumption | Near-optimal with regularized profiling |\n\n## Venue Fit Risks\n\n- **Incrementality over RateQuant**: Strongest reviewer attack. Defense: (a) discrete MCKP is fundamentally different from continuous waterfilling, (b) compounding effect discovery and constraint-based regularization are novel contributions, (c) RateQuant's additive assumption demonstrably fails (PPL 36.92 vs 11.23).\n- **Single-domain evaluation**: KV cache quantization only. Mitigate by testing across model families (Qwen, Llama, Mistral) with different GQA ratios.\n- **No eviction arm**: Original idea proposed joint eviction+quantization. Eviction was abandoned after MVP (attention MSE fails as distortion proxy for eviction). Mention as negative finding in paper; the MCKP framework itself extends naturally to include eviction once better eviction distortion metrics are developed.\n\n## Anticipated Reviewer Concerns\n\n1. **\"This is just RateQuant with MCKP instead of waterfilling\"** → Show waterfilling fails on discrete action sets (counterexample); show unconstrained MCKP also fails (PPL 36.92); our contribution is the constraint-regularized formulation.\n2. **\"Only tested on one model\"** → Multi-model experiments (Llama, Mistral) are P0.\n3. **\"Cardinality constraint is just a heuristic\"** → Show it has principled motivation (compounding effect non-additivity); characterize the compounding threshold empirically; show constraint value k can be determined systematically.\n4. **\"How does this work at different compression ratios?\"** → Budget sweep across 2×, 4×, 8× compression.\n5. **\"Profiler resolution is too low for mid-layer differentiation\"** → High-res profiling experiment (64 seq × 2048 tokens) to explore.\n","numLines":53,"startLine":1,"totalLines":53}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01F4MZs69CJdXEvTjFyZj1tM","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t[\n2\t  {\n3\t    \"name\": \"L0 Auto-Discovery (No L0 Exclusion)\",\n4\t    \"description\": \"去掉 L0 exclusion 硬约束，仅保留 max_2bit=8，观察 solver 是否仍从 profiling 数据自动将 Layer 0 heads 分配到 8-bit。\\n\",\n5\t    \"results\": {\n6\t      \"qwen_no_l0excl_ppl_wikitext\": 17.2,\n7\t      \"qwen_baseline_constrained_ppl\": 11.23,\n8\t      \"ppl_degradation_vs_constrained_pct\": 53.2,\n9\t      \"l0_heads_assigned_8bit\": 0,\n10\t      \"l0_heads_assigned_4bit\": 5,\n11\t      \"l0_heads_assigned_2bit\": 2,\n12\t      \"solver_auto_discovers_l0\": false\n13\t    },\n14\t    \"tables\": [\n15\t      {\n16\t        \"name\": \"L0 Exclusion Ablation\",\n17\t        \"columns\": [\n18\t          \"config\",\n19\t          \"l0_bitwidth\",\n20\t          \"ppl_wikitext\",\n21\t          \"delta_vs_constrained\"\n22\t        ],\n23\t        \"rows\": [\n24\t          [\n25\t            \"constrained_with_l0excl\",\n26\t            \"8-bit (forced)\",\n27\t            11.23,\n28\t            \"baseline\"\n29\t          ],\n30\t          [\n31\t            \"no_l0excl_max2bit8\",\n32\t            \"mixed 4/2-bit (solver)\",\n33\t            17.2,\n34\t            \"+53.2%\"\n35\t          ],\n36\t          [\n37\t            \"uniform_4bit\",\n38\t            \"4-bit\",\n39\t            15.45,\n40\t            \"+37.6%\"\n41\t          ]\n42\t        ]\n43\t      }\n44\t    ],\n45\t    \"figures\": [],\n46\t    \"analysis\": \"Solver 不仅未发现 L0，反而因 budget 优化将 L0 降级，结果比 uniform 更差。 这说明 \\\"automatic discovery\\\" claim 不成立——L0 protection 是 necessary prior knowledge。在 reframed narrative 中，这反而强化了 \\\"constraints as regularization\\\" 的论点：正确的 constraint 需要 model-specific knowledge， 而非纯数据驱动。\\n\\n\\nProfiler 在 per-head independent 测量下，L0 heads 的 delta 虽然绝对值最高， 但在 MCKP budget 竞争中，solver 倾向于将 8-bit 预算分配给中层若干 high-delta heads（它们的 delta-per-bit-cost ratio 更优）。L0 的关键性来自 其与后续层的 compounding interaction，而非 independent delta 本身。 去掉显式 L0 exclusion 后，solver 将 L0 部分 heads 降至 4-bit 甚至 2-bit， 触发严重的 compounding 劣化。PPL 从 11.23 恶化到 ~17.2（+53%）， 远超 10% 阈值。这证明 profiler 信号不足以自动发现 L0 的特殊地位， L0 exclusion 本质上是 domain knowledge injection 而非 data-driven discovery。\\n\"\n47\t  },\n48\t  {\n49\t    \"name\": \"Llama-3.1-8B Full Pipeline Replication\",\n50\t    \"description\": \"在 Llama-3.1-8B (GQA 4:1) 上复现完整 pipeline：profile → constrained MCKP → eval。\\n\",\n51\t    \"results\": {\n52\t      \"llama_uniform4bit_ppl_wikitext\": 8.95,\n53\t      \"llama_constrained_mckp_ppl_wikitext\": 8.31,\n54\t      \"llama_ppl_improvement_pct\": 7.2,\n55\t      \"llama_unconstrained_mckp_ppl\": 9.83,\n56\t      \"llama_l0_delta_rank\": \"not dominant (rank 12-18 among 32 layers)\",\n57\t      \"llama_num_heads_determining_70pct_degradation\": \"~15% of heads (vs Qwen 3.6%)\",\n58\t      \"llama_compounding_severity\": \"mild\",\n59\t      \"llama_optimal_max2bit\": 24\n60\t    },\n61\t    \"tables\": [\n62\t      {\n63\t        \"name\": \"Llama-3.1-8B Allocation Results\",\n64\t        \"columns\": [\n65\t          \"method\",\n66\t          \"ppl_wikitext\",\n67\t          \"compression\",\n68\t          \"improvement_vs_uniform\"\n69\t        ],\n70\t        \"rows\": [\n71\t          [\n72\t            \"uniform_4bit\",\n73\t            8.95,\n74\t            \"4×\",\n75\t            \"baseline\"\n76\t          ],\n77\t          [\n78\t            \"constrained_mckp\",\n79\t            8.31,\n80\t            \"4×\",\n81\t            \"7.2%\"\n82\t          ],\n83\t          [\n84\t            \"unconstrained_mckp\",\n85\t            9.83,\n86\t            \"4×\",\n87\t            \"-9.8% (worse than uniform)\"\n88\t          ]\n89\t        ]\n90\t      }\n91\t    ],\n92\t    \"figures\": [],\n93\t    \"analysis\": \"7.2% 改进虽然 positive 但 marginal——reviewer 会质疑是否 justifies method complexity。Unconstrained 未 catastrophic failure 意味着 Llama 上 cardinality constraint 的 motivation 更弱。核心发现：GQA ratio 越低， sensitivity 越分散，constrained MCKP 的边际收益越小。 这支持 \\\"sensitivity structure is architecture-dependent\\\" 的 reframed narrative。\\n\\n\\nLlama 的 GQA ratio 4:1（每层 8 KV heads，共 256 heads）使得 sensitivity 分布比 Qwen (GQA 7:1, 每层 4 KV heads, 共 112 heads) 更均匀。更多的 KV heads 意味着每个 head 承载更少的信息量，individual head 的 failure 影响更小。 L0 不再是 dominant sensitivity source——sensitivity 分散在多个层的多个 heads 上。 Constrained MCKP 仍优于 uniform（7.2%），但远低于 Qwen 的 27%， 因为 head heterogeneity 本身更低。Unconstrained MCKP 的 PPL（9.83）虽差于 constrained 但并未 catastrophic failure（对比 Qwen 的 36.92）， 因为 compounding effect 在 GQA 4:1 下更温和——更多 heads 分担了 extreme quantization 的 joint distortion。这削弱了 \\\"compounding is universal and catastrophic\\\" 的论点。\\n\"\n94\t  },\n95\t  {\n96\t    \"name\": \"Mistral-7B-v0.3 Full Pipeline Replication\",\n97\t    \"description\": \"在 Mistral-7B-v0.3 上复现完整 pipeline，建立跨架构有效性。\\n\",\n98\t    \"results\": {\n99\t      \"mistral_uniform4bit_ppl_wikitext\": 8.42,\n100\t      \"mistral_constrained_mckp_ppl_wikitext\": 7.93,\n101\t      \"mistral_ppl_improvement_pct\": 5.8,\n102\t      \"mistral_unconstrained_mckp_ppl\": 8.71,\n103\t      \"mistral_l0_delta_rank\": \"rank 5-8 among 32 layers\",\n104\t      \"mistral_sliding_window_complication\": true,\n105\t      \"mistral_optimal_max2bit\": 20\n106\t    },\n107\t    \"tables\": [\n108\t      {\n109\t        \"name\": \"Mistral-7B Results\",\n110\t        \"columns\": [\n111\t          \"method\",\n112\t          \"ppl_wikitext\",\n113\t          \"compression\",\n114\t          \"improvement_vs_uniform\"\n115\t        ],\n116\t        \"rows\": [\n117\t          [\n118\t            \"uniform_4bit\",\n119\t            8.42,\n120\t            \"4×\",\n121\t            \"baseline\"\n122\t          ],\n123\t          [\n124\t            \"constrained_mckp\",\n125\t            7.93,\n126\t            \"4×\",\n127\t            \"5.8%\"\n128\t          ],\n129\t          [\n130\t            \"unconstrained_mckp\",\n131\t            8.71,\n132\t            \"4×\",\n133\t            \"-3.4%\"\n134\t          ]\n135\t        ]\n136\t      }\n137\t    ],\n138\t    \"figures\": [],\n139\t    \"analysis\": \"Mistral 的 5.8% 改进是三个模型中最低的。Sliding window attention 使得 我们的 static profiling 假设部分失效。与 Llama 结果联合看， GQA 4:1 模型上 constrained MCKP 的 value proposition 弱于 GQA 7:1。 但这正是 reframed narrative 的核心 finding：GQA ratio 决定了 head sensitivity 的集中度，进而决定了 per-head allocation 的收益空间。\\n\\n\\nMistral 同样是 GQA 4:1（与 Llama 相同），但 sliding window attention 改变了 KV cache 的 usage pattern——早期 token 的 KV 被 evict，使得 对 precision 的依赖模式不同。Sensitivity 分布更接近 Llama（分散型）， 但 sliding window 还引入了 position-dependent sensitivity 的额外复杂度， 我们的 position-agnostic profiler 无法捕获。改进幅度 5.8% 进一步确认 低 GQA ratio 下 method 边际收益有限。Unconstrained MCKP PPL 8.71 仅比 uniform 差 3.4%——完全没有 catastrophic failure， 进一步削弱 compounding 的 universal catastrophic 叙事。\\n\"\n140\t  },\n141\t  {\n142\t    \"name\": \"Compounding Effect Sweep (Qwen)\",\n143\t    \"description\": \"在 Qwen2.5-7B 上 sweep max_2bit from 0 to 112，绘制 PPL vs max_2bit curve， 刻画 compounding threshold。\\n\",\n144\t    \"results\": {\n145\t      \"qwen_compounding_curve\": {\n146\t        \"max2bit_0\": 11.89,\n147\t        \"max2bit_4\": 11.45,\n148\t        \"max2bit_8\": 11.23,\n149\t        \"max2bit_16\": 11.31,\n150\t        \"max2bit_24\": 12.05,\n151\t        \"max2bit_48\": 15.78,\n152\t        \"max2bit_75\": 24.31,\n153\t        \"max2bit_112\": 36.92\n154\t      },\n155\t      \"elbow_k_qwen\": 8,\n156\t      \"curve_shape\": \"hockey stick with clear elbow at k=8\"\n157\t    },\n158\t    \"tables\": [\n159\t      {\n160\t        \"name\": \"Compounding Sweep (Qwen2.5-7B)\",\n161\t        \"columns\": [\n162\t          \"max_2bit_k\",\n163\t          \"ppl_wikitext\",\n164\t          \"num_heads_at_2bit_actual\",\n165\t          \"delta_vs_k8\"\n166\t        ],\n167\t        \"rows\": [\n168\t          [\n169\t            0,\n170\t            11.89,\n171\t            0,\n172\t            \"+5.9%\"\n173\t          ],\n174\t          [\n175\t            4,\n176\t            11.45,\n177\t            4,\n178\t            \"+2.0%\"\n179\t          ],\n180\t          [\n181\t            8,\n182\t            11.23,\n183\t            8,\n184\t            \"baseline\"\n185\t          ],\n186\t          [\n187\t            16,\n188\t            11.31,\n189\t            16,\n190\t            \"+0.7%\"\n191\t          ],\n192\t          [\n193\t            24,\n194\t            12.05,\n195\t            24,\n196\t            \"+7.3%\"\n197\t          ],\n198\t          [\n199\t            48,\n200\t            15.78,\n201\t            44,\n202\t            \"+40.5%\"\n203\t          ],\n204\t          [\n205\t            75,\n206\t            24.31,\n207\t            68,\n208\t            \"+116.6%\"\n209\t          ],\n210\t          [\n211\t            112,\n212\t            36.92,\n213\t            95,\n214\t            \"+228.8%\"\n215\t          ]\n216\t        ]\n217\t      }\n218\t    ],\n219\t    \"figures\": [],\n220\t    \"analysis\": \"Qwen 上 compounding curve 有教科书般清晰的 elbow，但问题在于 这种 pattern 是否跨模型复现——在 worst 档下，Llama 和 Mistral 上该 curve 预计平坦或无 elbow（见 plan_002/003 的 unconstrained 结果）。 Reframed narrative 将此作为 \\\"GQA-ratio-dependent compounding\\\" 的 case study 而非 universal phenomenon。\\n\\n\\nQwen 的 GQA 7:1 产生少量（112 个）但每个 information-dense 的 KV heads。 当少量 heads 被极端量化时，joint distortion 仍可控（k≤8 时 PPL 平稳）， 但超过阈值后 compounding 急剧恶化——因为 dense heads 之间的 interaction 在 extreme quantization 下是超线性的。k=8 处有清晰 elbow。 这个 curve 在 Qwen 上非常漂亮，是 paper 的核心 figure 之一。\\n\"\n221\t  },\n222\t  {\n223\t    \"name\": \"Budget Sweep (Qwen)\",\n224\t    \"description\": \"在 Qwen2.5-7B 上测试 constrained MCKP 在 2×, 4×, 8× 压缩率下的表现， 与同 budget 的 uniform baseline 对比。\\n\",\n225\t    \"results\": {\n226\t      \"qwen_2x_uniform_ppl\": 7.82,\n227\t      \"qwen_2x_constrained_ppl\": 7.45,\n228\t      \"qwen_2x_improvement_pct\": 4.7,\n229\t      \"qwen_4x_uniform_ppl\": 15.45,\n230\t      \"qwen_4x_constrained_ppl\": 11.23,\n231\t      \"qwen_4x_improvement_pct\": 27.3,\n232\t      \"qwen_8x_uniform_ppl\": 89.4,\n233\t      \"qwen_8x_constrained_ppl\": 42.6,\n234\t      \"qwen_8x_improvement_pct\": 52.3\n235\t    },\n236\t    \"tables\": [\n237\t      {\n238\t        \"name\": \"Budget Sweep (Qwen2.5-7B)\",\n239\t        \"columns\": [\n240\t          \"compression\",\n241\t          \"uniform_ppl\",\n242\t          \"constrained_ppl\",\n243\t          \"improvement_pct\"\n244\t        ],\n245\t        \"rows\": [\n246\t          [\n247\t            \"2×\",\n248\t            7.82,\n249\t            7.45,\n250\t            \"4.7%\"\n251\t          ],\n252\t          [\n253\t            \"4×\",\n254\t            15.45,\n255\t            11.23,\n256\t            \"27.3%\"\n257\t          ],\n258\t          [\n259\t            \"8×\",\n260\t            89.4,\n261\t            42.6,\n262\t            \"52.3%\"\n263\t          ]\n264\t        ]\n265\t      }\n266\t    ],\n267\t    \"figures\": [],\n268\t    \"analysis\": \"Budget sweep 在 Qwen 上 works well，但 reviewer 会要求看 Llama/Mistral 的 budget sweep——在 worst 档下这些预计仅有 2-5% 改进空间，弱化 method 的 general value proposition。 Reframe: 强调 per-head allocation 在高压缩率下更 critical， 且 benefit 与 architecture 的 sensitivity concentration 正相关。\\n\\n\\n2× 压缩下 budget 充裕（平均 8-bit），大部分 heads 已在安全区间， per-head optimization 的空间有限（4.7%）。4× 是 sweet spot（27.3%）， 与已有 MVP 结果一致。8× 极端压缩下，constrained MCKP 改进幅度最大 （52.3%）但绝对 PPL 仍然很高（42.6），因为 budget 不足以保护 所有 critical heads——即使最优分配也无法避免严重质量损失。 这些数字都是 Qwen-specific 的，鉴于 Llama/Mistral 在 4× 时 仅有 5-7% 改进，它们在 2× 和 8× 下的改进预计更小。\\n\"\n269\t  },\n270\t  {\n271\t    \"name\": \"High-Resolution Profiling (Qwen)\",\n272\t    \"description\": \"用 64 seq × 2048 tokens（vs 当前 16×512）做高分辨率 profiling， 重跑 MCKP，测试是否发现 mid-layer heterogeneity 并改善分配。\\n\",\n273\t    \"results\": {\n274\t      \"hires_nonzero_head_pct\": 31,\n275\t      \"lores_nonzero_head_pct\": 16,\n276\t      \"hires_constrained_ppl\": 11.09,\n277\t      \"lores_constrained_ppl\": 11.23,\n278\t      \"hires_improvement_over_lores_pct\": 1.2,\n279\t      \"hires_new_midlayer_discoveries\": 3,\n280\t      \"hires_profiling_time_hours\": 2.8\n281\t    },\n282\t    \"tables\": [\n283\t      {\n284\t        \"name\": \"Profiling Resolution Comparison\",\n285\t        \"columns\": [\n286\t          \"resolution\",\n287\t          \"nonzero_head_pct\",\n288\t          \"constrained_ppl\",\n289\t          \"profiling_hours\"\n290\t        ],\n291\t        \"rows\": [\n292\t          [\n293\t            \"16×512 (lores)\",\n294\t            \"16%\",\n295\t            11.23,\n296\t            0.7\n297\t          ],\n298\t          [\n299\t            \"64×2048 (hires)\",\n300\t            \"31%\",\n301\t            11.09,\n302\t            2.8\n303\t          ]\n304\t        ]\n305\t      }\n306\t    ],\n307\t    \"figures\": [],\n308\t    \"analysis\": \"Hires profiling 是 negative result：profiler resolution 并非 fundamental limitation，sensitivity 的 sparse 分布本身是 architecture 的 intrinsic property。这其实是 informative negative—— 说明 16×512 已经是 cost-effective 的 profiling budget。 但无法 claim \\\"better profiling → better allocation\\\"。\\n\\n\\n高分辨率 profiling 将 nonzero-delta heads 从 16% 提升到 31%， 确实发现了几个 mid-layer heads 有 measurable sensitivity。 但这些 newly-discovered heads 的 delta 仅占 total distortion 的 ~3%， 对 MCKP allocation 几乎无影响——solver 仍然做出几乎相同的分配决策。 PPL 仅从 11.23 降至 11.09（1.2% 改善），不足以 justify 4× 的 profiling compute overhead。根本原因：在 2-bit 分辨率下， 大部分 mid-layer heads 确实 insensitive（这是真信号而非 measurement noise），profiler resolution 不是 bottleneck， head sensitivity 的 long-tail distribution 本身是 fundamental。\\n\"\n309\t  },\n310\t  {\n311\t    \"name\": \"C4 Cross-Dataset Evaluation (Qwen)\",\n312\t    \"description\": \"在 C4 上评估 Qwen2.5-7B 的 constrained MCKP 和 uniform 4-bit， 测试结果是否 WikiText-2 specific。\\n\",\n313\t    \"results\": {\n314\t      \"c4_uniform4bit_ppl\": 18.73,\n315\t      \"c4_constrained_mckp_ppl\": 16.92,\n316\t      \"c4_improvement_pct\": 9.7,\n317\t      \"c4_rank_correlation_with_wikitext\": 0.58,\n318\t      \"c4_allocation_agreement_pct\": 72\n319\t    },\n320\t    \"tables\": [\n321\t      {\n322\t        \"name\": \"C4 Evaluation (Qwen2.5-7B)\",\n323\t        \"columns\": [\n324\t          \"dataset\",\n325\t          \"uniform_ppl\",\n326\t          \"constrained_ppl\",\n327\t          \"improvement_pct\"\n328\t        ],\n329\t        \"rows\": [\n330\t          [\n331\t            \"WikiText-2\",\n332\t            15.45,\n333\t            11.23,\n334\t            \"27.3%\"\n335\t          ],\n336\t          [\n337\t            \"C4\",\n338\t            18.73,\n339\t            16.92,\n340\t            \"9.7%\"\n341\t          ]\n342\t        ]\n343\t      },\n344\t      {\n345\t        \"name\": \"Cross-Dataset Allocation Agreement\",\n346\t        \"columns\": [\n347\t          \"metric\",\n348\t          \"value\"\n349\t        ],\n350\t        \"rows\": [\n351\t          [\n352\t            \"rank_correlation\",\n353\t            0.58\n354\t          ],\n355\t          [\n356\t            \"allocation_agreement\",\n357\t            \"72%\"\n358\t          ],\n359\t          [\n360\t            \"l0_protection_consistent\",\n361\t            \"yes\"\n362\t          ]\n363\t        ]\n364\t      }\n365\t    ],\n366\t    \"figures\": [],\n367\t    \"analysis\": \"C4 上 9.7% 改进刚好低于 10% 的 \\\"显著\\\" 阈值（在 worst 定义中）。 Rank correlation 0.58 处于 worst 范围内 [0.45, 0.7]。 这意味着 profiling 的 calibration data 选择 matters—— reviewer 会问 \\\"which calibration set should a practitioner use?\\\" Reframe: 承认 allocation 是 partially distribution-dependent， 但 L0 protection 是 robust across datasets。\\n\\n\\nC4 是更多样化的 web corpus，分布与 WikiText-2 有显著差异。 Per-head sensitivity 在 C4 上的排序与 WikiText-2 仅有中等相关 (rank corr 0.58)，因为不同 domain 的 text 激活不同 heads。 改进幅度从 27% 降至 9.7%——仍 positive 但显著缩水。 Allocation agreement 72% 意味着 ~28% 的 heads 在两个 dataset 上被分配了不同的 bit-width，暗示 optimal allocation 是 distribution-dependent 的。这弱化了 \\\"one-shot profiling\\\" 的实用性叙事。\\n\"\n368\t  },\n369\t  {\n370\t    \"name\": \"RateQuant Comparison (Reverse Waterfilling)\",\n371\t    \"description\": \"实现 RateQuant 的 reverse waterfilling 在离散 action set 上的版本， 与 constrained MCKP 对比。\\n\",\n372\t    \"results\": {\n373\t      \"llama_waterfilling_ppl\": 8.52,\n374\t      \"llama_constrained_ppl\": 8.31,\n375\t      \"llama_waterfilling_vs_mckp_gap\": 2.5,\n376\t      \"qwen_waterfilling_ppl\": 12.87,\n377\t      \"qwen_constrained_ppl\": 11.23,\n378\t      \"qwen_waterfilling_vs_mckp_gap\": 14.6\n379\t    },\n380\t    \"tables\": [\n381\t      {\n382\t        \"name\": \"Waterfilling vs MCKP\",\n383\t        \"columns\": [\n384\t          \"model\",\n385\t          \"waterfilling_ppl\",\n386\t          \"constrained_mckp_ppl\",\n387\t          \"gap_pct\"\n388\t        ],\n389\t        \"rows\": [\n390\t          [\n391\t            \"Qwen2.5-7B\",\n392\t            12.87,\n393\t            11.23,\n394\t            \"14.6%\"\n395\t          ],\n396\t          [\n397\t            \"Llama-3.1-8B\",\n398\t            8.52,\n399\t            8.31,\n400\t            \"2.5%\"\n401\t          ]\n402\t        ]\n403\t      }\n404\t    ],\n405\t    \"figures\": [],\n406\t    \"analysis\": \"在 Llama 上 waterfilling 与 MCKP 几乎等效（2.5% gap）， 削弱了 \\\"discrete MCKP is fundamentally necessary\\\" 的 claim。 Reviewer 会问：如果只在 GQA 7:1 模型上 MCKP 明显优于 waterfilling， 那这是 method contribution 还是 Qwen-specific trick？ Reframe: 强调 MCKP framework 的 flexibility（能自然嵌入 cardinality constraint，waterfilling 不行）。\\n\\n\\nReverse waterfilling 本质上是 continuous relaxation + rounding， 在 Llama 这种 sensitivity 分散的模型上，rounding error 较小 （因为 head 之间 delta 差异小，rounding 方向影响有限）， 所以 waterfilling 与 MCKP 差距仅 2.5%。在 Qwen 上差距更大 （14.6%），因为 L0 的 extreme sensitivity 导致 rounding 在 critical head 上犯错——但这个差距比 constrained vs unconstrained 的差距（11.23 vs 36.92）小得多，reviewer 可能认为 waterfilling + L0 heuristic 就足够了，不需要完整 MCKP machinery。\\n\"\n407\t  },\n408\t  {\n409\t    \"name\": \"Oracle Comparison (Brute-Force Subset)\",\n410\t    \"description\": \"在 Qwen 的 3-4 layer groups 上做 brute-force 穷举最优分配， 量化 MCKP 与 oracle 的差距。\\n\",\n411\t    \"results\": {\n412\t      \"oracle_subset_ppl\": 10.41,\n413\t      \"mckp_subset_ppl\": 10.78,\n414\t      \"mckp_to_oracle_gap_pct\": 3.6,\n415\t      \"oracle_allocation_agrees_with_mckp_pct\": 81\n416\t    },\n417\t    \"tables\": [\n418\t      {\n419\t        \"name\": \"Oracle vs MCKP (Subset, Qwen2.5-7B)\",\n420\t        \"columns\": [\n421\t          \"method\",\n422\t          \"subset_ppl\",\n423\t          \"gap_to_oracle\"\n424\t        ],\n425\t        \"rows\": [\n426\t          [\n427\t            \"brute_force_oracle\",\n428\t            10.41,\n429\t            \"0%\"\n430\t          ],\n431\t          [\n432\t            \"constrained_mckp\",\n433\t            10.78,\n434\t            \"3.6%\"\n435\t          ],\n436\t          [\n437\t            \"unconstrained_mckp\",\n438\t            14.93,\n439\t            \"43.4%\"\n440\t          ]\n441\t        ]\n442\t      }\n443\t    ],\n444\t    \"figures\": [],\n445\t    \"analysis\": \"3.6% gap 虽然不大但 non-trivial。在 reframed narrative 中， 这是 honest limitation：cardinality constraint 是 first-order approximation，full interaction structure 需要更复杂的 constraint 设计或 iterative profiling。\\n\\n\\n在小规模子集上，brute-force oracle 能利用 joint evaluation 捕捉 compounding interaction，找到 MCKP additive assumption 遗漏的 inter-head synergies。3.6% 的 gap 说明 MCKP 虽然 near-optimal 但并非 optimal——additive distortion model 即使加了 cardinality constraint 也有 residual error。 在 worst 档下，这个 gap 比预期大（理想情况应 <2%）， 暗示 compounding 的 non-additivity 比 cardinality constraint 能 capture 的更复杂（涉及 specific head combinations， 不仅仅是 count）。\\n\"\n446\t  },\n447\t  {\n448\t    \"name\": \"Cross-Domain Calibration Robustness\",\n449\t    \"description\": \"用 C4 calibrate、WikiText-2 evaluate（及反向），报告 per-head allocation 跨 calibration source 的一致率。\\n\",\n450\t    \"results\": {\n451\t      \"calib_c4_eval_wiki_ppl\": 12.14,\n452\t      \"calib_wiki_eval_wiki_ppl\": 11.23,\n453\t      \"calib_c4_eval_c4_ppl\": 16.92,\n454\t      \"calib_wiki_eval_c4_ppl\": 17.85,\n455\t      \"cross_calib_allocation_agreement_pct\": 68,\n456\t      \"l0_robust_across_calib\": true\n457\t    },\n458\t    \"tables\": [\n459\t      {\n460\t        \"name\": \"Cross-Calibration Results (Qwen2.5-7B)\",\n461\t        \"columns\": [\n462\t          \"calibration\",\n463\t          \"eval_dataset\",\n464\t          \"ppl\",\n465\t          \"vs_matched_calib\"\n466\t        ],\n467\t        \"rows\": [\n468\t          [\n469\t            \"WikiText-2\",\n470\t            \"WikiText-2\",\n471\t            11.23,\n472\t            \"baseline\"\n473\t          ],\n474\t          [\n475\t            \"C4\",\n476\t            \"WikiText-2\",\n477\t            12.14,\n478\t            \"+8.1%\"\n479\t          ],\n480\t          [\n481\t            \"C4\",\n482\t            \"C4\",\n483\t            16.92,\n484\t            \"baseline\"\n485\t          ],\n486\t          [\n487\t            \"WikiText-2\",\n488\t            \"C4\",\n489\t            17.85,\n490\t            \"+5.5%\"\n491\t          ]\n492\t        ]\n493\t      }\n494\t    ],\n495\t    \"figures\": [],\n496\t    \"analysis\": \"Cross-calibration degradation 是 real concern。Practitioner 需要 选择与 deployment distribution 匹配的 calibration data。 在 reframed narrative 中，这是 practical limitation 的 honest characterization，也是 future work direction。\\n\\n\\nCalibration data 影响 per-head delta 估计。C4 calibration 在 WikiText-2 上评估时 PPL 12.14（vs 同 domain 的 11.23）， degradation 8.1%。反向（wiki calib → C4 eval）degradation 5.5%。 Allocation agreement 68% 低于理想（>85%），说明约 1/3 的 heads 的最优 bit-width 是 distribution-dependent。 L0 protection 跨 calibration 一致（因为 L0 在任何 distribution 上 都是 dominant），但 mid-layer 分配不稳定。\\n\"\n497\t  },\n498\t  {\n499\t    \"name\": \"Head Sensitivity Visualization\",\n500\t    \"description\": \"生成 paper-quality figures：per-head delta heatmap、compounding curve、 budget allocation comparison。\\n\",\n501\t    \"results\": {\n502\t      \"figures_generated\": 4,\n503\t      \"key_visual_finding\": \"cross-model heatmap comparison dramatically shows architecture-dependent sensitivity\"\n504\t    },\n505\t    \"tables\": [],\n506\t    \"figures\": [],\n507\t    \"analysis\": \"Visualization 在 worst 档下反而更有 impact，因为跨模型差异 本身就是 visually striking finding。\\n\\n\\nVisualization 本身不产生新数据，但在 worst 档下，cross-model heatmap 成为 paper 最重要的 figure——直观展示 Qwen (concentrated, L0-dominant) vs Llama/Mistral (dispersed, no single dominant layer) 的对比。Compounding curve 只在 Qwen 上有 dramatic elbow， Llama/Mistral 的 curve 相对平坦。这些 visual 恰好 serve reframed narrative。\\n\"\n508\t  },\n509\t  {\n510\t    \"name\": \"Downstream Task Evaluation (MMLU/LongBench)\",\n511\t    \"description\": \"在 Qwen2.5-7B 4× 压缩下跑 MMLU 和 LongBench，测试 PPL 改进 是否 translate to downstream performance。\\n\",\n512\t    \"results\": {\n513\t      \"qwen_fp16_mmlu\": 68.2,\n514\t      \"qwen_uniform4bit_mmlu\": 64.1,\n515\t      \"qwen_constrained_mmlu\": 65.8,\n516\t      \"qwen_mmlu_recovery_pct\": 41.5,\n517\t      \"qwen_fp16_longbench_avg\": 45.3,\n518\t      \"qwen_uniform4bit_longbench_avg\": 38.7,\n519\t      \"qwen_constrained_longbench_avg\": 41.2,\n520\t      \"qwen_longbench_recovery_pct\": 37.9\n521\t    },\n522\t    \"tables\": [\n523\t      {\n524\t        \"name\": \"Downstream Performance (Qwen2.5-7B, 4×)\",\n525\t        \"columns\": [\n526\t          \"task\",\n527\t          \"fp16\",\n528\t          \"uniform_4bit\",\n529\t          \"constrained_mckp\",\n530\t          \"recovery_pct\"\n531\t        ],\n532\t        \"rows\": [\n533\t          [\n534\t            \"MMLU\",\n535\t            68.2,\n536\t            64.1,\n537\t            65.8,\n538\t            \"41.5%\"\n539\t          ],\n540\t          [\n541\t            \"LongBench_avg\",\n542\t            45.3,\n543\t            38.7,\n544\t            41.2,\n545\t            \"37.9%\"\n546\t          ]\n547\t        ]\n548\t      }\n549\t    ],\n550\t    \"figures\": [],\n551\t    \"analysis\": \"Downstream results 是 positive but modest。在 worst 档下 不足以作为 strong selling point。建议在 paper 中放为 supplementary experiment，主叙事仍以 PPL 为核心 metric， downstream 作为 sanity check。\\n\\n\\nPPL 改进（27%）不会线性 translate 到 downstream tasks。 MMLU 是 knowledge-intensive 的 multiple-choice task， quantization 主要影响 calibration（logit precision）而非 knowledge recall，所以 recovery 有限（41.5%）。 LongBench 涉及 long context，KV cache quantization 对 long-range attention 的影响更大，但 constrained MCKP 的 per-head allocation 在 long context 下的 optimality 可能不同于 short context（profiling 用 2048 tokens）， 导致 recovery 更低（37.9%）。整体 downstream improvement 存在但 modest，不足以成为独立 claim。\\n\"\n552\t  },\n553\t  {\n554\t    \"name\": \"70B Profiling-Only (Qwen2.5-72B)\",\n555\t    \"description\": \"在 Qwen2.5-72B 上只跑 distortion profiling（不做完整 eval）， 分析 sensitivity patterns 是否随 model size 缩放。\\n\",\n556\t    \"results\": {\n557\t      \"qwen72b_l0_dominance\": true,\n558\t      \"qwen72b_l0_delta_ratio_vs_avg\": \"~60× (vs 7B 的 100×)\",\n559\t      \"qwen72b_nonzero_head_pct\": 22,\n560\t      \"qwen72b_sensitivity_concentration\": \"5.1% heads cover 70% degradation\",\n561\t      \"qwen72b_gqa_ratio\": \"7:1 (same as 7B)\"\n562\t    },\n563\t    \"tables\": [\n564\t      {\n565\t        \"name\": \"Scale Comparison (Qwen Family)\",\n566\t        \"columns\": [\n567\t          \"model\",\n568\t          \"layers\",\n569\t          \"kv_heads\",\n570\t          \"l0_delta_ratio\",\n571\t          \"nonzero_pct\",\n572\t          \"top_heads_for_70pct\"\n573\t        ],\n574\t        \"rows\": [\n575\t          [\n576\t            \"Qwen2.5-7B\",\n577\t            28,\n578\t            112,\n579\t            \"100×\",\n580\t            \"16%\",\n581\t            \"3.6%\"\n582\t          ],\n583\t          [\n584\t            \"Qwen2.5-72B\",\n585\t            80,\n586\t            320,\n587\t            \"60×\",\n588\t            \"22%\",\n589\t            \"5.1%\"\n590\t          ]\n591\t        ]\n592\t      }\n593\t    ],\n594\t    \"figures\": [],\n595\t    \"analysis\": \"72B profiling 支持 GQA-ratio-dependent sensitivity hypothesis—— 同 GQA ratio 的不同 model sizes 有相似但不完全相同的 pattern。 在 worst 档下，这是 supporting evidence for reframed narrative， 但不足以 claim \\\"method scales to 70B\\\" 因为我们没有做完整 eval。 作为 paper 的 supplementary evidence 足够。\\n\\n72B 与 7B 共享 GQA 7:1 架构，所以 L0 dominance 保持（支持 GQA-ratio-dependent hypothesis）。但 72B 有 80 layers vs 7B 的 28， 更多层分摊了 sensitivity，L0 的 relative dominance 降低 （60× vs 100×）。Nonzero head pct 22% 略高于 7B 的 16%， 因为更深的 model 有更多层的 heads 对 quantization 有 non-trivial sensitivity。但 concentration 仍然高（5.1%）， 确认 GQA 7:1 架构的 sensitivity 集中特性。\\n\"\n596\t  }\n597\t]"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8677deac-59c8-4ca5-9523-f1a6bbd8dccb","uuid":"3dcb1a6f-598b-4c10-b1fe-509e637c9e46","timestamp":"2026-05-14T00:44:54.660Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_2/projects/ratekv/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260514T002109/worst/experiment_data.json","content":"[\n  {\n    \"name\": \"L0 Auto-Discovery (No L0 Exclusion)\",\n    \"description\": \"去掉 L0 exclusion 硬约束，仅保留 max_2bit=8，观察 solver 是否仍从 profiling 数据自动将 Layer 0 heads 分配到 8-bit。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"qwen_no_l0excl_ppl_wikitext\": 17.2,\n      \"qwen_baseline_constrained_ppl\": 11.23,\n      \"ppl_degradation_vs_constrained_pct\": 53.2,\n      \"l0_heads_assigned_8bit\": 0,\n      \"l0_heads_assigned_4bit\": 5,\n      \"l0_heads_assigned_2bit\": 2,\n      \"solver_auto_discovers_l0\": false\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"L0 Exclusion Ablation\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"config\",\n          \"l0_bitwidth\",\n          \"ppl_wikitext\",\n          \"delta_vs_constrained\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"constrained_with_l0excl\",\n            \"8-bit (forced)\",\n            11.23,\n            \"baseline\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"no_l0excl_max2bit8\",\n            \"mixed 4/2-bit (solver)\",\n            17.2,\n            \"+53.2%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"uniform_4bit\",\n            \"4-bit\",\n            15.45,\n            \"+37.6%\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Solver 不仅未发现 L0，反而因 budget 优化将 L0 降级，结果比 uniform 更差。 这说明 \\\"automatic discovery\\\" claim 不成立——L0 protection 是 necessary prior knowledge。在 reframed narrative 中，这反而强化了 \\\"constraints as regularization\\\" 的论点：正确的 constraint 需要 model-specific knowledge， 而非纯数据驱动。\\n\\n\\nProfiler 在 per-head independent 测量下，L0 heads 的 delta 虽然绝对值最高， 但在 MCKP budget 竞争中，solver 倾向于将 8-bit 预算分配给中层若干 high-delta heads（它们的 delta-per-bit-cost ratio 更优）。L0 的关键性来自 其与后续层的 compounding interaction，而非 independent delta 本身。 去掉显式 L0 exclusion 后，solver 将 L0 部分 heads 降至 4-bit 甚至 2-bit， 触发严重的 compounding 劣化。PPL 从 11.23 恶化到 ~17.2（+53%）， 远超 10% 阈值。这证明 profiler 信号不足以自动发现 L0 的特殊地位， L0 exclusion 本质上是 domain knowledge injection 而非 data-driven discovery。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Llama-3.1-8B Full Pipeline Replication\",\n    \"description\": \"在 Llama-3.1-8B (GQA 4:1) 上复现完整 pipeline：profile → constrained MCKP → eval。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"llama_uniform4bit_ppl_wikitext\": 8.95,\n      \"llama_constrained_mckp_ppl_wikitext\": 8.31,\n      \"llama_ppl_improvement_pct\": 7.2,\n      \"llama_unconstrained_mckp_ppl\": 9.83,\n      \"llama_l0_delta_rank\": \"not dominant (rank 12-18 among 32 layers)\",\n      \"llama_num_heads_determining_70pct_degradation\": \"~15% of heads (vs Qwen 3.6%)\",\n      \"llama_compounding_severity\": \"mild\",\n      \"llama_optimal_max2bit\": 24\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Llama-3.1-8B Allocation Results\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"method\",\n          \"ppl_wikitext\",\n          \"compression\",\n          \"improvement_vs_uniform\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"uniform_4bit\",\n            8.95,\n            \"4×\",\n            \"baseline\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"constrained_mckp\",\n            8.31,\n            \"4×\",\n            \"7.2%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"unconstrained_mckp\",\n            9.83,\n            \"4×\",\n            \"-9.8% (worse than uniform)\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"7.2% 改进虽然 positive 但 marginal——reviewer 会质疑是否 justifies method complexity。Unconstrained 未 catastrophic failure 意味着 Llama 上 cardinality constraint 的 motivation 更弱。核心发现：GQA ratio 越低， sensitivity 越分散，constrained MCKP 的边际收益越小。 这支持 \\\"sensitivity structure is architecture-dependent\\\" 的 reframed narrative。\\n\\n\\nLlama 的 GQA ratio 4:1（每层 8 KV heads，共 256 heads）使得 sensitivity 分布比 Qwen (GQA 7:1, 每层 4 KV heads, 共 112 heads) 更均匀。更多的 KV heads 意味着每个 head 承载更少的信息量，individual head 的 failure 影响更小。 L0 不再是 dominant sensitivity source——sensitivity 分散在多个层的多个 heads 上。 Constrained MCKP 仍优于 uniform（7.2%），但远低于 Qwen 的 27%， 因为 head heterogeneity 本身更低。Unconstrained MCKP 的 PPL（9.83）虽差于 constrained 但并未 catastrophic failure（对比 Qwen 的 36.92）， 因为 compounding effect 在 GQA 4:1 下更温和——更多 heads 分担了 extreme quantization 的 joint distortion。这削弱了 \\\"compounding is universal and catastrophic\\\" 的论点。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Mistral-7B-v0.3 Full Pipeline Replication\",\n    \"description\": \"在 Mistral-7B-v0.3 上复现完整 pipeline，建立跨架构有效性。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"mistral_uniform4bit_ppl_wikitext\": 8.42,\n      \"mistral_constrained_mckp_ppl_wikitext\": 7.93,\n      \"mistral_ppl_improvement_pct\": 5.8,\n      \"mistral_unconstrained_mckp_ppl\": 8.71,\n      \"mistral_l0_delta_rank\": \"rank 5-8 among 32 layers\",\n      \"mistral_sliding_window_complication\": true,\n      \"mistral_optimal_max2bit\": 20\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Mistral-7B Results\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"method\",\n          \"ppl_wikitext\",\n          \"compression\",\n          \"improvement_vs_uniform\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"uniform_4bit\",\n            8.42,\n            \"4×\",\n            \"baseline\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"constrained_mckp\",\n            7.93,\n            \"4×\",\n            \"5.8%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"unconstrained_mckp\",\n            8.71,\n            \"4×\",\n            \"-3.4%\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Mistral 的 5.8% 改进是三个模型中最低的。Sliding window attention 使得 我们的 static profiling 假设部分失效。与 Llama 结果联合看， GQA 4:1 模型上 constrained MCKP 的 value proposition 弱于 GQA 7:1。 但这正是 reframed narrative 的核心 finding：GQA ratio 决定了 head sensitivity 的集中度，进而决定了 per-head allocation 的收益空间。\\n\\n\\nMistral 同样是 GQA 4:1（与 Llama 相同），但 sliding window attention 改变了 KV cache 的 usage pattern——早期 token 的 KV 被 evict，使得 对 precision 的依赖模式不同。Sensitivity 分布更接近 Llama（分散型）， 但 sliding window 还引入了 position-dependent sensitivity 的额外复杂度， 我们的 position-agnostic profiler 无法捕获。改进幅度 5.8% 进一步确认 低 GQA ratio 下 method 边际收益有限。Unconstrained MCKP PPL 8.71 仅比 uniform 差 3.4%——完全没有 catastrophic failure， 进一步削弱 compounding 的 universal catastrophic 叙事。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Compounding Effect Sweep (Qwen)\",\n    \"description\": \"在 Qwen2.5-7B 上 sweep max_2bit from 0 to 112，绘制 PPL vs max_2bit curve， 刻画 compounding threshold。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"qwen_compounding_curve\": {\n        \"max2bit_0\": 11.89,\n        \"max2bit_4\": 11.45,\n        \"max2bit_8\": 11.23,\n        \"max2bit_16\": 11.31,\n        \"max2bit_24\": 12.05,\n        \"max2bit_48\": 15.78,\n        \"max2bit_75\": 24.31,\n        \"max2bit_112\": 36.92\n      },\n      \"elbow_k_qwen\": 8,\n      \"curve_shape\": \"hockey stick with clear elbow at k=8\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Compounding Sweep (Qwen2.5-7B)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"max_2bit_k\",\n          \"ppl_wikitext\",\n          \"num_heads_at_2bit_actual\",\n          \"delta_vs_k8\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            0,\n            11.89,\n            0,\n            \"+5.9%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            4,\n            11.45,\n            4,\n            \"+2.0%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            8,\n            11.23,\n            8,\n            \"baseline\"\n          ],\n          [\n            16,\n            11.31,\n            16,\n            \"+0.7%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            24,\n            12.05,\n            24,\n            \"+7.3%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            48,\n            15.78,\n            44,\n            \"+40.5%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            75,\n            24.31,\n            68,\n            \"+116.6%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            112,\n            36.92,\n            95,\n            \"+228.8%\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Qwen 上 compounding curve 有教科书般清晰的 elbow，但问题在于 这种 pattern 是否跨模型复现——在 worst 档下，Llama 和 Mistral 上该 curve 预计平坦或无 elbow（见 plan_002/003 的 unconstrained 结果）。 Reframed narrative 将此作为 \\\"GQA-ratio-dependent compounding\\\" 的 case study 而非 universal phenomenon。\\n\\n\\nQwen 的 GQA 7:1 产生少量（112 个）但每个 information-dense 的 KV heads。 当少量 heads 被极端量化时，joint distortion 仍可控（k≤8 时 PPL 平稳）， 但超过阈值后 compounding 急剧恶化——因为 dense heads 之间的 interaction 在 extreme quantization 下是超线性的。k=8 处有清晰 elbow。 这个 curve 在 Qwen 上非常漂亮，是 paper 的核心 figure 之一。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Budget Sweep (Qwen)\",\n    \"description\": \"在 Qwen2.5-7B 上测试 constrained MCKP 在 2×, 4×, 8× 压缩率下的表现， 与同 budget 的 uniform baseline 对比。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"qwen_2x_uniform_ppl\": 7.82,\n      \"qwen_2x_constrained_ppl\": 7.45,\n      \"qwen_2x_improvement_pct\": 4.7,\n      \"qwen_4x_uniform_ppl\": 15.45,\n      \"qwen_4x_constrained_ppl\": 11.23,\n      \"qwen_4x_improvement_pct\": 27.3,\n      \"qwen_8x_uniform_ppl\": 89.4,\n      \"qwen_8x_constrained_ppl\": 42.6,\n      \"qwen_8x_improvement_pct\": 52.3\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Budget Sweep (Qwen2.5-7B)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"compression\",\n          \"uniform_ppl\",\n          \"constrained_ppl\",\n          \"improvement_pct\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"2×\",\n            7.82,\n            7.45,\n            \"4.7%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"4×\",\n            15.45,\n            11.23,\n            \"27.3%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"8×\",\n            89.4,\n            42.6,\n            \"52.3%\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Budget sweep 在 Qwen 上 works well，但 reviewer 会要求看 Llama/Mistral 的 budget sweep——在 worst 档下这些预计仅有 2-5% 改进空间，弱化 method 的 general value proposition。 Reframe: 强调 per-head allocation 在高压缩率下更 critical， 且 benefit 与 architecture 的 sensitivity concentration 正相关。\\n\\n\\n2× 压缩下 budget 充裕（平均 8-bit），大部分 heads 已在安全区间， per-head optimization 的空间有限（4.7%）。4× 是 sweet spot（27.3%）， 与已有 MVP 结果一致。8× 极端压缩下，constrained MCKP 改进幅度最大 （52.3%）但绝对 PPL 仍然很高（42.6），因为 budget 不足以保护 所有 critical heads——即使最优分配也无法避免严重质量损失。 这些数字都是 Qwen-specific 的，鉴于 Llama/Mistral 在 4× 时 仅有 5-7% 改进，它们在 2× 和 8× 下的改进预计更小。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"High-Resolution Profiling (Qwen)\",\n    \"description\": \"用 64 seq × 2048 tokens（vs 当前 16×512）做高分辨率 profiling， 重跑 MCKP，测试是否发现 mid-layer heterogeneity 并改善分配。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"hires_nonzero_head_pct\": 31,\n      \"lores_nonzero_head_pct\": 16,\n      \"hires_constrained_ppl\": 11.09,\n      \"lores_constrained_ppl\": 11.23,\n      \"hires_improvement_over_lores_pct\": 1.2,\n      \"hires_new_midlayer_discoveries\": 3,\n      \"hires_profiling_time_hours\": 2.8\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Profiling Resolution Comparison\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"resolution\",\n          \"nonzero_head_pct\",\n          \"constrained_ppl\",\n          \"profiling_hours\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"16×512 (lores)\",\n            \"16%\",\n            11.23,\n            0.7\n          ],\n          [\n            \"64×2048 (hires)\",\n            \"31%\",\n            11.09,\n            2.8\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Hires profiling 是 negative result：profiler resolution 并非 fundamental limitation，sensitivity 的 sparse 分布本身是 architecture 的 intrinsic property。这其实是 informative negative—— 说明 16×512 已经是 cost-effective 的 profiling budget。 但无法 claim \\\"better profiling → better allocation\\\"。\\n\\n\\n高分辨率 profiling 将 nonzero-delta heads 从 16% 提升到 31%， 确实发现了几个 mid-layer heads 有 measurable sensitivity。 但这些 newly-discovered heads 的 delta 仅占 total distortion 的 ~3%， 对 MCKP allocation 几乎无影响——solver 仍然做出几乎相同的分配决策。 PPL 仅从 11.23 降至 11.09（1.2% 改善），不足以 justify 4× 的 profiling compute overhead。根本原因：在 2-bit 分辨率下， 大部分 mid-layer heads 确实 insensitive（这是真信号而非 measurement noise），profiler resolution 不是 bottleneck， head sensitivity 的 long-tail distribution 本身是 fundamental。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"C4 Cross-Dataset Evaluation (Qwen)\",\n    \"description\": \"在 C4 上评估 Qwen2.5-7B 的 constrained MCKP 和 uniform 4-bit， 测试结果是否 WikiText-2 specific。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"c4_uniform4bit_ppl\": 18.73,\n      \"c4_constrained_mckp_ppl\": 16.92,\n      \"c4_improvement_pct\": 9.7,\n      \"c4_rank_correlation_with_wikitext\": 0.58,\n      \"c4_allocation_agreement_pct\": 72\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"C4 Evaluation (Qwen2.5-7B)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"dataset\",\n          \"uniform_ppl\",\n          \"constrained_ppl\",\n          \"improvement_pct\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"WikiText-2\",\n            15.45,\n            11.23,\n            \"27.3%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"C4\",\n            18.73,\n            16.92,\n            \"9.7%\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Cross-Dataset Allocation Agreement\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"metric\",\n          \"value\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"rank_correlation\",\n            0.58\n          ],\n          [\n            \"allocation_agreement\",\n            \"72%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"l0_protection_consistent\",\n            \"yes\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"C4 上 9.7% 改进刚好低于 10% 的 \\\"显著\\\" 阈值（在 worst 定义中）。 Rank correlation 0.58 处于 worst 范围内 [0.45, 0.7]。 这意味着 profiling 的 calibration data 选择 matters—— reviewer 会问 \\\"which calibration set should a practitioner use?\\\" Reframe: 承认 allocation 是 partially distribution-dependent， 但 L0 protection 是 robust across datasets。\\n\\n\\nC4 是更多样化的 web corpus，分布与 WikiText-2 有显著差异。 Per-head sensitivity 在 C4 上的排序与 WikiText-2 仅有中等相关 (rank corr 0.58)，因为不同 domain 的 text 激活不同 heads。 改进幅度从 27% 降至 9.7%——仍 positive 但显著缩水。 Allocation agreement 72% 意味着 ~28% 的 heads 在两个 dataset 上被分配了不同的 bit-width，暗示 optimal allocation 是 distribution-dependent 的。这弱化了 \\\"one-shot profiling\\\" 的实用性叙事。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"RateQuant Comparison (Reverse Waterfilling)\",\n    \"description\": \"实现 RateQuant 的 reverse waterfilling 在离散 action set 上的版本， 与 constrained MCKP 对比。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"llama_waterfilling_ppl\": 8.52,\n      \"llama_constrained_ppl\": 8.31,\n      \"llama_waterfilling_vs_mckp_gap\": 2.5,\n      \"qwen_waterfilling_ppl\": 12.87,\n      \"qwen_constrained_ppl\": 11.23,\n      \"qwen_waterfilling_vs_mckp_gap\": 14.6\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Waterfilling vs MCKP\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"model\",\n          \"waterfilling_ppl\",\n          \"constrained_mckp_ppl\",\n          \"gap_pct\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Qwen2.5-7B\",\n            12.87,\n            11.23,\n            \"14.6%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Llama-3.1-8B\",\n            8.52,\n            8.31,\n            \"2.5%\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"在 Llama 上 waterfilling 与 MCKP 几乎等效（2.5% gap）， 削弱了 \\\"discrete MCKP is fundamentally necessary\\\" 的 claim。 Reviewer 会问：如果只在 GQA 7:1 模型上 MCKP 明显优于 waterfilling， 那这是 method contribution 还是 Qwen-specific trick？ Reframe: 强调 MCKP framework 的 flexibility（能自然嵌入 cardinality constraint，waterfilling 不行）。\\n\\n\\nReverse waterfilling 本质上是 continuous relaxation + rounding， 在 Llama 这种 sensitivity 分散的模型上，rounding error 较小 （因为 head 之间 delta 差异小，rounding 方向影响有限）， 所以 waterfilling 与 MCKP 差距仅 2.5%。在 Qwen 上差距更大 （14.6%），因为 L0 的 extreme sensitivity 导致 rounding 在 critical head 上犯错——但这个差距比 constrained vs unconstrained 的差距（11.23 vs 36.92）小得多，reviewer 可能认为 waterfilling + L0 heuristic 就足够了，不需要完整 MCKP machinery。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Oracle Comparison (Brute-Force Subset)\",\n    \"description\": \"在 Qwen 的 3-4 layer groups 上做 brute-force 穷举最优分配， 量化 MCKP 与 oracle 的差距。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"oracle_subset_ppl\": 10.41,\n      \"mckp_subset_ppl\": 10.78,\n      \"mckp_to_oracle_gap_pct\": 3.6,\n      \"oracle_allocation_agrees_with_mckp_pct\": 81\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Oracle vs MCKP (Subset, Qwen2.5-7B)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"method\",\n          \"subset_ppl\",\n          \"gap_to_oracle\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"brute_force_oracle\",\n            10.41,\n            \"0%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"constrained_mckp\",\n            10.78,\n            \"3.6%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"unconstrained_mckp\",\n            14.93,\n            \"43.4%\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"3.6% gap 虽然不大但 non-trivial。在 reframed narrative 中， 这是 honest limitation：cardinality constraint 是 first-order approximation，full interaction structure 需要更复杂的 constraint 设计或 iterative profiling。\\n\\n\\n在小规模子集上，brute-force oracle 能利用 joint evaluation 捕捉 compounding interaction，找到 MCKP additive assumption 遗漏的 inter-head synergies。3.6% 的 gap 说明 MCKP 虽然 near-optimal 但并非 optimal——additive distortion model 即使加了 cardinality constraint 也有 residual error。 在 worst 档下，这个 gap 比预期大（理想情况应 <2%）， 暗示 compounding 的 non-additivity 比 cardinality constraint 能 capture 的更复杂（涉及 specific head combinations， 不仅仅是 count）。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Cross-Domain Calibration Robustness\",\n    \"description\": \"用 C4 calibrate、WikiText-2 evaluate（及反向），报告 per-head allocation 跨 calibration source 的一致率。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"calib_c4_eval_wiki_ppl\": 12.14,\n      \"calib_wiki_eval_wiki_ppl\": 11.23,\n      \"calib_c4_eval_c4_ppl\": 16.92,\n      \"calib_wiki_eval_c4_ppl\": 17.85,\n      \"cross_calib_allocation_agreement_pct\": 68,\n      \"l0_robust_across_calib\": true\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Cross-Calibration Results (Qwen2.5-7B)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"calibration\",\n          \"eval_dataset\",\n          \"ppl\",\n          \"vs_matched_calib\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"WikiText-2\",\n            \"WikiText-2\",\n            11.23,\n            \"baseline\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"C4\",\n            \"WikiText-2\",\n            12.14,\n            \"+8.1%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"C4\",\n            \"C4\",\n            16.92,\n            \"baseline\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"WikiText-2\",\n            \"C4\",\n            17.85,\n            \"+5.5%\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Cross-calibration degradation 是 real concern。Practitioner 需要 选择与 deployment distribution 匹配的 calibration data。 在 reframed narrative 中，这是 practical limitation 的 honest characterization，也是 future work direction。\\n\\n\\nCalibration data 影响 per-head delta 估计。C4 calibration 在 WikiText-2 上评估时 PPL 12.14（vs 同 domain 的 11.23）， degradation 8.1%。反向（wiki calib → C4 eval）degradation 5.5%。 Allocation agreement 68% 低于理想（>85%），说明约 1/3 的 heads 的最优 bit-width 是 distribution-dependent。 L0 protection 跨 calibration 一致（因为 L0 在任何 distribution 上 都是 dominant），但 mid-layer 分配不稳定。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Head Sensitivity Visualization\",\n    \"description\": \"生成 paper-quality figures：per-head delta heatmap、compounding curve、 budget allocation comparison。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"figures_generated\": 4,\n      \"key_visual_finding\": \"cross-model heatmap comparison dramatically shows architecture-dependent sensitivity\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Visualization 在 worst 档下反而更有 impact，因为跨模型差异 本身就是 visually striking finding。\\n\\n\\nVisualization 本身不产生新数据，但在 worst 档下，cross-model heatmap 成为 paper 最重要的 figure——直观展示 Qwen (concentrated, L0-dominant) vs Llama/Mistral (dispersed, no single dominant layer) 的对比。Compounding curve 只在 Qwen 上有 dramatic elbow， Llama/Mistral 的 curve 相对平坦。这些 visual 恰好 serve reframed narrative。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Downstream Task Evaluation (MMLU/LongBench)\",\n    \"description\": \"在 Qwen2.5-7B 4× 压缩下跑 MMLU 和 LongBench，测试 PPL 改进 是否 translate to downstream performance。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"qwen_fp16_mmlu\": 68.2,\n      \"qwen_uniform4bit_mmlu\": 64.1,\n      \"qwen_constrained_mmlu\": 65.8,\n      \"qwen_mmlu_recovery_pct\": 41.5,\n      \"qwen_fp16_longbench_avg\": 45.3,\n      \"qwen_uniform4bit_longbench_avg\": 38.7,\n      \"qwen_constrained_longbench_avg\": 41.2,\n      \"qwen_longbench_recovery_pct\": 37.9\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Downstream Performance (Qwen2.5-7B, 4×)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"task\",\n          \"fp16\",\n          \"uniform_4bit\",\n          \"constrained_mckp\",\n          \"recovery_pct\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"MMLU\",\n            68.2,\n            64.1,\n            65.8,\n            \"41.5%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"LongBench_avg\",\n            45.3,\n            38.7,\n            41.2,\n            \"37.9%\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Downstream results 是 positive but modest。在 worst 档下 不足以作为 strong selling point。建议在 paper 中放为 supplementary experiment，主叙事仍以 PPL 为核心 metric， downstream 作为 sanity check。\\n\\n\\nPPL 改进（27%）不会线性 translate 到 downstream tasks。 MMLU 是 knowledge-intensive 的 multiple-choice task， quantization 主要影响 calibration（logit precision）而非 knowledge recall，所以 recovery 有限（41.5%）。 LongBench 涉及 long context，KV cache quantization 对 long-range attention 的影响更大，但 constrained MCKP 的 per-head allocation 在 long context 下的 optimality 可能不同于 short context（profiling 用 2048 tokens）， 导致 recovery 更低（37.9%）。整体 downstream improvement 存在但 modest，不足以成为独立 claim。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"70B Profiling-Only (Qwen2.5-72B)\",\n    \"description\": \"在 Qwen2.5-72B 上只跑 distortion profiling（不做完整 eval）， 分析 sensitivity patterns 是否随 model size 缩放。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"qwen72b_l0_dominance\": true,\n      \"qwen72b_l0_delta_ratio_vs_avg\": \"~60× (vs 7B 的 100×)\",\n      \"qwen72b_nonzero_head_pct\": 22,\n      \"qwen72b_sensitivity_concentration\": \"5.1% heads cover 70% degradation\",\n      \"qwen72b_gqa_ratio\": \"7:1 (same as 7B)\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Scale Comparison (Qwen Family)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"model\",\n          \"layers\",\n          \"kv_heads\",\n          \"l0_delta_ratio\",\n          \"nonzero_pct\",\n          \"top_heads_for_70pct\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Qwen2.5-7B\",\n            28,\n            112,\n            \"100×\",\n            \"16%\",\n            \"3.6%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Qwen2.5-72B\",\n            80,\n            320,\n            \"60×\",\n            \"22%\",\n            \"5.1%\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"72B profiling 支持 GQA-ratio-dependent sensitivity hypothesis—— 同 GQA ratio 的不同 model sizes 有相似但不完全相同的 pattern。 在 worst 档下，这是 supporting evidence for reframed narrative， 但不足以 claim \\\"method scales to 70B\\\" 因为我们没有做完整 eval。 作为 paper 的 supplementary evidence 足够。\\n\\n72B 与 7B 共享 GQA 7:1 架构，所以 L0 dominance 保持（支持 GQA-ratio-dependent hypothesis）。但 72B 有 80 layers vs 7B 的 28， 更多层分摊了 sensitivity，L0 的 relative dominance 降低 （60× vs 100×）。Nonzero head pct 22% 略高于 7B 的 16%， 因为更深的 model 有更多层的 heads 对 quantization 有 non-trivial sensitivity。但 concentration 仍然高（5.1%）， 确认 GQA 7:1 架构的 sensitivity 集中特性。\\n\"\n  }\n]","numLines":597,"startLine":1,"totalLines":597}}}
